3	//! Reusable in-process mock OpenAI upstream for the gateway's egress tests (G6 here; G7 reuses
4	//! it). It binds an ephemeral `127.0.0.1` port, serves `POST /v1/chat/completions`, RECORDS the
5	//! request headers + body it received (so a test can assert the caller's key never arrived and the
6	//! injected real key did), and returns either a canned JSON body (non-stream) or an SSE stream of
7	//! ordered `data:` frames. Model: the ephemeral-listener pattern from `paigasus-iam`'s
8	//! `tests/support::start_mock_idp` / `tests/grpc_health.rs`.
9	
10	// Not every test binary that includes this module uses every helper; silence the per-binary
11	// dead-code lint rather than sprinkle `#[allow]` on each item.
12	#![allow(dead_code)]
